※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4641

※ Called through a function value, nothing at the call says which parameters
※ write the arrays they are handed, so nothing could check that the array is
※ one that may be written.

@[impure]
fn clear(a: mut u8⟦⟧):
    a⟦0⟧ ← 0u8

@[startup, impure]
fn main() → u6:
    let f: fn(u8⟦⟧) = clear
    0u6
